- Any involvement in approving or denying overtime hours.

#### B. Manager 2: Payroll / Operations / Administrative Oversight
Key topics:
- Policies and practices for recording, approving, and paying overtime;
- Whether Ellis’s hours were tracked accurately;
- Knowledge of any off-the-clock work or work performed beyond scheduled shifts;
- Whether Ellis was instructed, explicitly or implicitly, not to record overtime;
- Any communications regarding staffing shortages, workload, or expectations that may have led to unpaid overtime.

